    ],
    "status": "present",
    "value": "Generate n NFTs with duplicates allowed, where each trait value has a positive integer weight. For each NFT and trait in order, take the next random r, let x = r mod (sum of weights), and choose the first value whose cumulative weight exceeds x. randoms has exactly n * len(traits) entries. Randomness is injected: randoms is a deterministic list of non-negative integers (each <= 10^15) consumed in order. Each NFT is returned as the list of chosen values in trait order."
  },
